25:["$","p","p-7",{"children":"Ordering is a separate concern. A standard queue may deliver out of order. If two jobs update the same document, use a version or sequence check so an older export request cannot overwrite a newer result. A FIFO queue can help with broker order, but it does not replace state validation."}]
